+
+STRUCTURAL_HINT: str = (
+    "Reduce the three matrices modulo p: the diagonal of M is a permuted roots-of-unity grid, so factor the ratios P[i][j]/X[i][j], inverse-NTT the two evaluation vectors, and take their outer product."
+)
