+        "An n by n JSON matrix Lambda. Every entry is an integer in "
+        "0 <= lambda_ij < q=p^n, and validity is the exact E_p^(n) identity "
+        "P=sum_{i,j=0}^{n-1} lambda_ij M^i X M^j."
